Notes on bundled assets:

- Face PNGs (`web/faces/*.png`, `images/comparison/face/*.png`) are sourced
  from publicly circulated 熊猫头 (panda head) memes. Original faces are
  attributed to the source individuals (e.g. 金馆长 / 崔成国 et al.) and are
  presented under research / educational fair use, not for commercial purpose.
- Shell PNGs (`web/shells/*.png`) are derived from public meme circulation
  in Chinese-speaking internet (Baidu Tieba, Weibo, etc.) and are similarly
  presented under fair use.
- Bundled fonts are loaded via Google Fonts CDN under their respective Open
  Font licenses (OFL / Apache 2.0).
